    "Eight of twelve same-basename local files are normalized-SQL matches to the remote ledger source; four differ and their exact remote variants are separately archived. The basic_plan_lead_management remote source changes the shared plan_features catalogue, while the local same-basename file is intentionally a no-op to avoid changing India entitlements; do not replay that remote source blindly.",
