    "The three Global tax migrations dated 20261114000002 through 20261114000004 and the exact Cashfree refund mapping migration 20261114000005 are current local-only migrations and are included in the disposable candidate replay.",
    "202611150002_global_owner_provisioning.sql adds service_role-only RPC wrappers for Global auth context, idempotent owner workspace provisioning, and Global profile updates. It is included in the disposable 66-entry candidate replay; business data remains in the global schema.",
    "202611150004_global_business_records_rpc.sql adds a service_role-only public RPC that keeps the global schema private from PostgREST while enforcing active Global workspace membership for client/product/expense CRUD and read-only invoice/inventory listing.",
    "The four Global migrations were applied to the existing Supabase project on 2026-11-14 through the Supabase migration API. Their recorded remote versions are 20261114163116, 20261114163144, 20261114163149, and 20261114163153; the matching local SQL files are tracked in basename_matches for replay convergence.",
