    "202611150007_global_inventory_movement_rpc.sql adds a service-role-only atomic Global stock movement RPC, idempotency protection, and automatic zero-stock rows for new products. It is included in the 68-entry disposable candidate replay.",
    "202611150006_global_trigger_function_privileges.sql removes API-role execution from the internal Global timestamp trigger helper; it is included in disposable replay.",
    "202611150008_global_invoice_draft_and_payment_ledger.sql adds service-role-only Global draft invoice creation and idempotent external-payment recording; draft invoices are explicitly marked tax-not-calculated and cannot be issued as tax invoices.",
    "202611160002_global_tax_audit_and_publication.sql adds service-role-only tax-rule publication and immutable workspace tax-calculation audit records; candidate replay only.",
    "202611160003_global_multicurrency_expenses.sql adds source-attributed foreign-currency expense posting with immutable FX snapshots/conversion history and idempotent retries; candidate replay only.",
